<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hugo on Alfero Chingono</title><link>https://www.chingono.com/tags/hugo/</link><description>Recent content in Hugo on Alfero Chingono</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 11 Apr 2022 11:53:23 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.chingono.com/tags/hugo/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Add Favicon to a Hugo-Based Website</title><link>https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/27/adding-favicon-hugo-site/</link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Mar 2022 18:39:35 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/27/adding-favicon-hugo-site/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/27/adding-favicon-hugo-site/cover.png" alt="Featured image of post Add Favicon to a Hugo-Based Website" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;A favicon, which is an abbreviation of the word &amp;ldquo;favorite icon&amp;rdquo;, is a small icon that helps users visually identify and distinguish your website. Its main purpose is to help visitors locate your page easier when they have multiple tabs, bookmarks, shortcuts, and address bars open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With so many platforms, devices, icon formats, and dimensions, it&amp;rsquo;s hard to know exactly what you should do to consistently present your website icon/brand everywhere. That&amp;rsquo;s the reason why there are multiple favicon generators available. Just a quick search for &amp;ldquo;favicon generator&amp;rdquo; will reveal a long list of websites that assist in creating favicons supported across a wide range of platforms, and devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The one I chose for this case was &lt;a class="link" href="https://favicon.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;favicon.io&lt;/a&gt;. This process could&amp;rsquo;ve been accomplished with &lt;a class="link" href="https://realfavicongenerator.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;realfavicongenerator.net&lt;/a&gt; just as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All I had to do was take a cropped version of my profile picture. It&amp;rsquo;s important that the picture be square, by the way. Then uploaded it to &lt;a class="link" href="https://favicon.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;favicon.io&lt;/a&gt; and out came a zip file with everything I needed. Once downloaded, I extracted the zip file and copied the contents to the &amp;ldquo;static&amp;rdquo; folder of my Hugo site:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/27/adding-favicon-hugo-site/static-folder.jpg"
width="409"
height="360"
srcset="https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/27/adding-favicon-hugo-site/static-folder_hu_e0f256780d55ee1d.jpg 480w, https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/27/adding-favicon-hugo-site/static-folder_hu_b864aaf0864af128.jpg 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="Contents of static folder"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="113"
data-flex-basis="272px"
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next step was to simply copy the HTML snippet generated on the download page and paste it into &lt;code&gt;layouts/partials/head/custom.html&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-HTML" data-lang="HTML"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;rel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;apple-touch-icon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;sizes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;180x180&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;href&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/apple-touch-icon.png&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;rel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;icon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;image/png&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;sizes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;32x32&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;href&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/favicon-32x32.png&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;rel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;icon&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;image/png&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;sizes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;16x16&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;href&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/favicon-16x16.png&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;link&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;rel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;manifest&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;href&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/site.webmanifest&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;And that was it! I hope you find this post valuable, dear reader. All comments and feedback greatly appreciated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;References:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/CaiJimmy/hugo-theme-stack/issues/42#issuecomment-716052364" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Add favicon in config.toml · Issue #42&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hugo blog powered by GitHub Pages and GitHub Codespaces</title><link>https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/15/hugo-blog-powered-by-github-pages-codespaces/</link><pubDate>Tue, 15 Mar 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/15/hugo-blog-powered-by-github-pages-codespaces/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.chingono.com/blog/2022/03/15/hugo-blog-powered-by-github-pages-codespaces/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Hugo blog powered by GitHub Pages and GitHub Codespaces" /&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clone repo in Codespaces&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add Hugo devcontainer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click the &amp;ldquo;Codespaces&amp;rdquo; button in the bottom-left corner of Visual Studio Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;ldquo;Add Development Container Configuration Files&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;ldquo;Show All Definitions&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;ldquo;Hugo (Community)&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click &amp;ldquo;OK&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create new hugo site:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&amp;gt;hugo new site blog
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Try to create new hugo module &lt;a class="link" href="https://docs.stack.jimmycai.com/getting-started" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;https://docs.stack.jimmycai.com/getting-started&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&amp;gt;hugo mod init github.com/achingono/achingono.github.io
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Error: failed to init modules: binary with name &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;go&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; not found
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add go binary to devcontainer docker file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-docker" data-lang="docker"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# GO version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ARG&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;GO_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="m"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;#Download Go&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt; wget https://golang.org/dl/go1.&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;GO_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;.linux-amd64.tar.gz &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; tar -C /usr/local -xzf go1.&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;GO_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;.linux-amd64.tar.gz &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; rm go1.&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;GO_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;.linux-amd64.tar.gz&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ENV&lt;/span&gt; GOPATH /go&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ENV&lt;/span&gt; PATH &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$GOPATH&lt;/span&gt;/bin:/usr/local/go/bin:&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$PATH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check go version&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&amp;gt;go version
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go version go1.18 linux/amd64
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn new site into a Hugo module:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&amp;gt;hugo mod init github.com/achingono/achingono.github.io
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go: creating new go.mod: module github.com/achingono/achingono.github.io
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go: to add module requirements and sums:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; go mod tidy
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Declare the hugo-theme-stack module as a dependency of your site:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&amp;gt;hugo mod get github.com/CaiJimmy/hugo-theme-stack/v3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go: downloading github.com/CaiJimmy/hugo-theme-stack/v3 v3.10.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go: downloading github.com/CaiJimmy/hugo-theme-stack v2.6.0+incompatible
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go: added github.com/CaiJimmy/hugo-theme-stack/v3 v3.10.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grab config file from example site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&amp;gt;wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CaiJimmy/hugo-theme-stack/master/exampleSite/config.yaml
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update &lt;code&gt;config.yaml&lt;/code&gt; file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;19
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;20
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;21
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;22
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;23
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;24
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;25
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;26
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;27
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;28
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;29
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;30
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;31
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;32
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;33
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;34
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;35
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;36
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;37
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;38
